sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Mobile
    participant Backend
    participant S3
    participant RabbitMQ
    participant EmbedWorker as Embedding Worker
    participant ES as Elasticsearch

    Note over User,ES: Note Creation & Semantic Search Pipeline

    User->>Mobile: Create note (title, subject, body)
    Mobile->>Backend: POST /notes {title, subject, body}
    Backend->>Backend: Save note metadata to PostgreSQL
    Backend->>S3: Upload note body (key: noteId)
    Backend->>RabbitMQ: Publish NoteProcessingEvent
    Backend-->>Mobile: 201 NoteResponseDto

    RabbitMQ->>EmbedWorker: Consume from note.processing.queue
    EmbedWorker->>S3: Fetch note body
    S3-->>EmbedWorker: Raw text
    EmbedWorker->>EmbedWorker: Compute embedding (Qwen3-0.6B, 1024-dim)
    EmbedWorker->>ES: Upsert document with vector embedding
    EmbedWorker->>EmbedWorker: Compute semantic links to other notes
    EmbedWorker->>Backend: Update semantic_links in PostgreSQL

    Note over User,ES: Semantic Search

    User->>Mobile: Search query
    Mobile->>Backend: GET /search/semantic?query=...
    Backend->>ES: kNN vector search (topK=5, minScore=0.75)
    ES-->>Backend: Scored document IDs
    Backend->>Backend: Join with note metadata from PostgreSQL
    Backend-->>Mobile: List of scored notes

    Note over User,ES: Related Notes

    User->>Mobile: Open note detail
    Mobile->>Backend: GET /notes/{id}/related
    Backend->>Backend: Query semantic_links table
    Backend-->>Mobile: List of related notes
